2217
02:53:05,982 --> 02:53:08,522
See that you don’t refuse him who speaks.

2218
02:53:08,992 --> 02:53:15,072
For if they didn’t escape when they refused
him who warned on the earth, how much more

2219
02:53:15,112 --> 02:53:21,592
