2272
02:57:28,311 --> 02:57:29,431
Grace be with you all.

2273
02:57:30,151 --> 02:57:31,051
Amen.

2274
02:57:31,151 --> 02:57:32,211
First John, chapter one.

2275
02:57:33,130 --> 02:57:38,750
That which was from the beginning, that which
we have heard, that which we have seen

2276
02:57:38,790 --> 02:57:45,350
with our eyes, that which we saw, and our
hands touched, concerning the Word of

2277
02:57:45,390 --> 02:57:51,970
life (and the life was revealed, and we
have seen, and testify, and declare to

2278
02:57:52,010 --> 02:57:59,410
