2294
02:59:08,050 --> 02:59:13,510
My little children, I write these things
to you so that you may not sin.

2295
02:59:13,990 --> 02:59:20,230
If anyone sins, we have a Counsellor with
the Father, Jesus Christ, the righteous.

2296
02:59:20,770 --> 02:59:27,030
And he is the atoning sacrifice for our sins,
and not for ours only, but also for the

2297
02:59:27,070 --> 02:59:27,970
whole world.

2298
02:59:28,290 --> 02:59:32,230
This is how we know that we know him: if
we keep his commandments.

2299
02:59:33,210 --> 02:59:39,530
One who says, “I know him,” and doesn’t
