2316
03:00:59,525 --> 03:01:04,225
I write to you, young men, because you
have overcome the evil one.

2317
03:01:05,005 --> 03:01:08,745
I write to you, little children, because
you know the Father.

2318
03:01:09,385 --> 03:01:13,785
I have written to you, fathers, because
you know him who is from the beginning.

2319
03:01:14,865 --> 03:01:20,145
I have written to you, young men, because
you are strong, and the word of God remains

2320
03:01:20,185 --> 03:01:23,565
