one.

2321
03:01:24,445 --> 03:01:27,565
Don’t love the world or the things that
are in the world.

2322
03:01:28,165 --> 03:01:32,425
If anyone loves the world, the Father’s
love isn’t in him.

2323
03:01:33,365 --> 03:01:39,705
For all that is in the world—the lust of
the flesh, the lust of the eyes, and the pride

2324
03:01:39,745 --> 03:01:43,785
of life—isn’t the Father’s, but is the
world’s.

2325
03:01:44,025 --> 03:01:50,305
The world is passing away with its lusts,
but he who does God’s will remains forever.

2326
03:01:51,265 --> 03:01:57,305
Little children, these are the end times, and
as you heard that the Antichrist is coming,

2327
03:01:57,865 --> 03:02:00,525
even now many antichrists have arisen.

2328
03:02:01,505 --> 03:02:04,485
By this we know that it is the final hour.

2329
03:02:04,525 --> 03:02:10,525
They went out from us, but they didn’t belong
to us; for if they had belonged to us,

2330
03:02:10,885 --> 03:02:12,525
they would have continued with us.

2331
03:02:12,945 --> 03:02:18,225
But they left, that they might be revealed
that none of them belong to us.

2332
03:02:18,599 --> 03:02:22,659
You have an anointing from the Holy One,
and you all have knowledge.

2333
03:02:23,939 --> 03:02:29,219
I have not written to you because you
don’t know the truth, but because you know it,

2334
03:02:29,539 --> 03:02:32,099
and because no lie is of the truth.

2335
03:02:33,179 --> 03:02:37,479
Who is the liar but he who denies that
Jesus is the Christ?

2336
03:02:38,239 --> 03:02:42,399
This is the Antichrist, he who denies the
Father and the Son.

2337
03:02:43,479 --> 03:02:46,539
Whoever denies the Son doesn’t have the
Father.

2338
03:02:47,479 --> 03:02:50,579
He who confesses the Son has the Father
also.

2339
03:02:51,599 --> 03:02:56,639
Therefore, as for you, let that remain in
you which you heard from the beginning.

2340
03:02:57,259 --> 03:03:02,319
If that which you heard from the beginning
remains in you, you also will remain in the

2341
03:03:02,359 --> 03:03:03,959
Son, and in the Father.

2342
03:03:04,639 --> 03:03:08,899
This is the promise which he promised us,
the eternal life.

2343
03:03:09,979 --> 03:03:14,239
These things I have written to you
concerning those who would lead you astray.

2344
03:03:14,689 --> 03:03:21,359
As for you, the anointing which you received
from him remains in you, and you don’t need

2345
03:03:21,399 --> 03:03:22,939
for anyone to teach you.

2346
03:03:23,739 --> 03:03:30,639
But as his anointing teaches you concerning all
things, and is true, and is no lie, and

2347
03:03:30,679 --> 03:03:33,739
even as it taught you, you will remain in
him.

2348
03:03:34,339 --> 03:03:40,899
Now, little children, remain in him, that
when he appears, we may have boldness

2349
03:03:40,939 --> 03:03:43,779
and not be ashamed before him at his
coming.

2350
03:03:45,039 --> 03:03:49,919
If you know that he is righteous, you know
that everyone who practices righteousness

2351
03:03:49,959 --> 03:03:51,819
has been born of him.

2352
03:03:51,859 --> 03:03:54,939
First John, chapter three.

2353
03:03:54,979 --> 03:04:00,739
See how great a love the Father has given
to us, that we should be called children of

2354
03:04:00,779 --> 03:04:01,679
God!

2355
03:04:02,119 --> 03:04:06,719
For this cause the world doesn’t know us,
because it didn’t know him.

2356
03:04:07,739 --> 03:04:10,879
Beloved, now we are children of God.

2357
03:04:10,919 --> 03:04:17,919
It is not yet revealed what we will be;
but we know that when he is revealed, we

2358
03:04:17,959 --> 03:04:21,819
will be like him, for we will see him just
as he is.

2359
03:04:22,959 --> 03:04:29,119
Everyone who has this hope set on him
purifies himself, even as he is pure.

2360
03:04:30,279 --> 03:04:33,579
Everyone who sins also commits
lawlessness.

2361
03:04:34,419 --> 03:04:35,999
Sin is lawlessness.

2362
03:04:36,549 --> 03:04:42,299
You know that he was revealed to take away
our sins, and no sin is in him.

2363
03:04:43,179 --> 03:04:45,659
Whoever remains in him doesn’t sin.

2364
03:04:46,479 --> 03:04:50,019
Whoever sins hasn’t seen him and doesn’t
know him.

2365
03:04:50,296 --> 03:04:53,776
Little children, let no one lead you
astray.

2366
03:04:54,896 --> 03:04:59,896
He who does righteousness is righteous,
even as he is righteous.

2367
03:05:00,756 --> 03:05:06,256
He who sins is of the devil, for the devil
has been sinning from the beginning.

2368
03:05:06,296 --> 03:05:12,556
To this end the Son of God was revealed:
that he might destroy the works of the devil.

2369
03:05:13,376 --> 03:05:20,136
Whoever is born of God doesn’t commit sin,
because his seed remains in him, and he can’t

2370
03:05:20,176 --> 03:05:22,376
sin, because he is born of God.

2371
03:05:23,616 --> 03:05:28,116
In this the children of God are revealed,
and the children of the devil.

2372
03:05:28,476 --> 03:05:34,636
Whoever doesn’t do righteousness is not of God,
neither is he who doesn’t love his brother.

2373
03:05:35,316 --> 03:05:40,336
For this is the message which you heard
from the beginning, that we should love one another—

2374
03:05:41,136 --> 03:05:45,236
unlike Cain, who was of the evil one and
killed his brother.

2375
03:05:46,156 --> 03:05:47,616
Why did he kill him?

2376
03:05:48,376 --> 03:05:51,636
Because his deeds were evil, and his
brother’s righteous.

2377
03:05:52,136 --> 03:05:55,476
Don’t be surprised, my brothers, if the
world hates you.

2378
03:05:55,956 --> 03:06:01,096
We know that we have passed out of death
into life, because we love the brothers.

2379
03:06:02,096 --> 03:06:05,296
He who doesn’t love his brother remains in
death.

2380
03:06:06,316 --> 03:06:12,176
Whoever hates his brother is a murderer, and
you know that no murderer has eternal life

2381
03:06:12,216 --> 03:06:13,196
remaining in him.

2382
03:06:13,236 --> 03:06:17,696
By this we know love, because he laid down
his life for us.

2383
03:06:18,136 --> 03:06:20,736
And we ought to lay down our lives for the
brothers.

2384
03:06:21,876 --> 03:06:27,896
But whoever has the world’s goods and sees
his brother in need, then closes his heart

2385
03:06:27,936 --> 03:06:32,576
of compassion against him, how does God’s
love remain in him?

2386
03:06:33,216 --> 03:06:39,956
My little children, let’s not love in word
only, or with the tongue only, but

2387
03:06:40,256 --> 03:06:40,996
in deed and truth.

2388
03:06:41,036 --> 03:06:47,676
And by this we know that we are of the
truth and persuade our hearts before him,

2389
03:06:48,456 --> 03:06:54,316
because if our heart condemns us, God is
greater than our heart, and knows all things.

2390
03:06:55,036 --> 03:07:01,496
Beloved, if our hearts don’t condemn us,
we have boldness towards God; so whatever

2391
03:07:01,536 --> 03:07:08,116
we ask, we receive from him, because we
keep his commandments and do the things that

2392
03:07:08,156 --> 03:07:09,516
are pleasing in his sight.

2393
03:07:09,825 --> 03:07:15,825
This is his commandment, that we should believe
in the name of his Son, Jesus Christ,

2394
03:07:16,385 --> 03:07:19,525
and love one another, even as he
commanded.

2395
03:07:20,945 --> 03:07:25,945
He who keeps his commandments remains in
him, and he in him.

2396
03:07:26,365 --> 03:07:31,005
By this we know that he remains in us, by
the Spirit which he gave us.

2397
03:07:31,045 --> 03:07:34,605
First John, chapter four.

2398
03:07:34,645 --> 03:07:41,225
Beloved, don’t believe every spirit, but
test the spirits, whether they are of God,

2399
03:07:41,885 --> 03:07:45,265
because many false prophets have gone out
into the world.

2400
03:07:46,005 --> 03:07:51,885
By this you know the Spirit of God: every
spirit who confesses that Jesus Christ has

2401
03:07:51,925 --> 03:07:58,125
come in the flesh is of God, and
every spirit who doesn’t confess that Jesus Christ has

2402
03:07:58,165 --> 03:08:04,765
come in the flesh is not of God; and
this is the spirit of the Antichrist, of whom you

2403
03:08:04,805 --> 03:08:05,945
have heard that it comes.

2404
03:08:06,725 --> 03:08:08,385
Now it is in the world already.

2405
03:08:09,405 --> 03:08:15,945
You are of God, little children, and have
overcome them, because greater is he who

2406
03:08:15,985 --> 03:08:18,265
is in you than he who is in the world.

2407
03:08:19,105 --> 03:08:20,245
They are of the world.

2408
03:08:21,005 --> 03:08:24,645
Therefore they speak of the world, and the
world hears them.

2409
03:08:24,945 --> 03:08:25,845
We are of God.

2410
03:08:26,585 --> 03:08:29,105
He who knows God listens to us.

2411
03:08:29,685 --> 03:08:32,785
He who is not of God doesn’t listen to us.

2412
03:08:33,425 --> 03:08:37,265
By this we know the spirit of truth, and
the spirit of error.

2413
03:08:37,705 --> 03:08:44,045
Beloved, let’s love one another, for love
is of God; and everyone who loves has been

2414
03:08:44,085 --> 03:08:46,045
born of God and knows God.

2415
03:08:46,085 --> 03:08:50,845
He who doesn’t love doesn’t know God, for
God is love.

2416
03:08:51,525 --> 03:08:58,245
By this God’s love was revealed in us, that
God has sent his only born Son into the

2417
03:08:58,285 --> 03:09:00,465
world that we might live through him.

2418
03:09:00,505 --> 03:09:06,965
In this is love, not that we loved God,
but that he loved us,

2419
03:09:07,005 --> 03:09:16,025
and sent his Son as

2420
03:09:16,065 --> 03:09:16,365
the atoning sacrifice for our sins.

2421
03:09:16,405 --> 03:09:18,065
Beloved, if God loved us in this way, we
also ought to love one another.

2422
03:09:19,125 --> 03:09:21,425
No one has seen God at any time.

2423
03:09:22,445 --> 03:09:28,545
If we love one another, God remains in us,
and his love has been perfected in us.

2424
03:09:28,885 --> 03:09:35,425
By this we know that we remain in him and
he in us, because he has given us of his Spirit.

2425
03:09:36,005 --> 03:09:42,145
We have seen and testify that the Father has
sent the Son as the Saviour of the world.

2426
03:09:42,532 --> 03:09:49,012
Whoever confesses that Jesus is the Son of
God, God remains in him, and

2427
03:09:49,052 --> 03:09:49,952
he in God.

2428
03:09:50,712 --> 03:09:54,792
We know and have believed the love which
God has for us.

2429
03:09:55,632 --> 03:10:02,212
God is love, and he who remains in love
remains in God, and God

2430
03:10:02,252 --> 03:10:03,392
remains in him.

2431
03:10:04,072 --> 03:10:10,172
In this, love has been made perfect amongst
us, that we may have boldness in the day

2432
03:10:10,212 --> 03:10:15,312
of judgement, because as he is, even so we
are in this world.

2433
03:10:16,272 --> 03:10:23,032
There is no fear in love; but perfect
love casts out fear, because fear has punishment.

2434
03:10:24,152 --> 03:10:27,052
He who fears is not made perfect in love.

2435
03:10:27,572 --> 03:10:30,232
We love him, because he first loved us.

2436
03:10:31,032 --> 03:10:37,672
If a man says, “I love God,” and hates his
brother, he is a liar; for he

2437
03:10:37,712 --> 03:10:43,412
who doesn’t love his brother whom he has seen,
how can he love God whom he has not seen?

2438
03:10:43,872 --> 03:10:49,272
This commandment we have from him, that he
who loves God should also love his brother.

2439
03:10:49,312 --> 03:10:52,612
First John, chapter five.

2440
03:10:52,652 --> 03:10:57,272
Whoever believes that Jesus is the Christ
has been born of God.

2441
03:10:58,272 --> 03:11:02,712
Whoever loves the Father also loves the
child who is born of him.

2442
03:11:03,832 --> 03:11:10,032
By this we know that we love the children
of God, when we love God and keep his commandments.

2443
03:11:10,952 --> 03:11:14,072
For this is loving God, that we keep his
commandments.

2444
03:11:15,132 --> 03:11:17,472
His commandments are not grievous.

2445
03:11:17,992 --> 03:11:21,152
For whatever is born of God overcomes the
world.

2446
03:11:21,952 --> 03:11:26,272
This is the victory that has overcome the
world: your faith.

2447
03:11:26,672 --> 03:11:32,652
Who is he who overcomes the world, but he
who believes that Jesus is the Son of God?

2448
03:11:33,412 --> 03:11:40,072
This is he who came by water and blood,
Jesus Christ; not with the water only,

2449
03:11:40,792 --> 03:11:42,492
but with the water and the blood.

2450
03:11:43,272 --> 03:11:48,052
It is the Spirit who testifies, because
the Spirit is the truth.

2451
03:11:49,012 --> 03:11:55,092
For there are three who testify: the Spirit,
the water, and the blood; and the three

2452
03:11:55,132 --> 03:11:56,072
agree as one.

2453
03:11:56,572 --> 03:12:03,312
If we receive the witness of men, the witness
of God is greater; for this is God’s testimony

2454
03:12:03,352 --> 03:12:06,252
which he has testified concerning his Son.

2455
03:12:07,412 --> 03:12:11,752
He who believes in the Son of God has the
testimony in himself.

2456
03:12:12,382 --> 03:12:18,402
He who doesn’t believe God has made him a
liar, because he has not believed in the testimony

2457
03:12:18,442 --> 03:12:21,082
that God has given concerning his Son.

2458
03:12:22,042 --> 03:12:28,722
The testimony is this: that God gave to us
eternal life, and this life is in

2459
03:12:28,762 --> 03:12:29,662
his Son.

2460
03:12:29,802 --> 03:12:31,842
He who has the Son has the life.

2461
03:12:32,602 --> 03:12:35,602
He who doesn’t have God’s Son doesn’t have
the life.

2462
03:12:36,422 --> 03:12:42,502
These things I have written to you who believe
in the name of the Son of God, that you

2463
03:12:42,542 --> 03:12:47,902
may know that you have eternal life, and
that you may continue to believe in the name

2464
03:12:47,942 --> 03:12:48,982
of the Son of God.

2465
03:12:49,662 --> 03:12:55,102
This is the boldness which we have towards
him, that if we ask anything according to

2466
03:12:55,142 --> 03:12:57,442
his will, he listens to us.

2467
03:12:58,162 --> 03:13:04,222
And if we know that he listens to us,
whatever we ask, we know that we have the petitions

2468
03:13:04,262 --> 03:13:05,882
which we have asked of him.

2469
03:13:05,922 --> 03:13:12,682
If anyone sees his brother sinning a sin
not leading to death, he shall ask, and

2470
03:13:12,722 --> 03:13:16,262
God will give him life for those who sin
not leading to death.

2471
03:13:17,202 --> 03:13:19,302
There is sin leading to death.

2472
03:13:20,002 --> 03:13:23,382
I don’t say that he should make a request
concerning this.

2473
03:13:24,122 --> 03:13:28,502
All unrighteousness is sin, and there is
sin not leading to death.

2474
03:13:29,542 --> 03:13:36,122
We know that whoever is born of God doesn’t
sin, but he who was born of God keeps himself,

2475
03:13:36,962 --> 03:13:38,962
and the evil one doesn’t touch him.

2476
03:13:39,302 --> 03:13:44,442
We know that we are of God, and the whole
world lies in the power of the evil one.

2477
03:13:45,042 --> 03:13:50,722
We know that the Son of God has come
and has given us an understanding, that we know

2478
03:13:50,762 --> 03:13:57,062
him who is true; and we are in him who is
true, in his Son Jesus Christ.

2479
03:13:57,622 --> 03:14:00,322
This is the true God and eternal life.

2480
03:14:00,362 --> 03:14:04,482
Little children, keep yourselves from
idols.

2481
03:14:05,642 --> 03:14:07,722
Colossians, chapter one.

2482
03:14:07,762 --> 03:14:14,582
Paul, an apostle of Christ Jesus through the
will of God, and Timothy our brother, to

2483
03:14:14,622 --> 03:14:21,182
the saints and faithful brothers in Christ
at Colossae: Grace to you and peace from

2484
03:14:21,222 --> 03:14:24,202
God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.

2485
03:14:24,604 --> 03:14:31,824
We give thanks to God the Father of
our Lord Jesus Christ, praying always for you, having

2486
03:14:31,864 --> 03:14:37,824
heard of your faith in Christ Jesus and of
the love which you have towards all the saints,

2487
03:14:38,744 --> 03:14:43,424
because of the hope which is laid up for
you in the heavens, of which you heard before

2488
03:14:43,464 --> 03:14:49,904
in the word of the truth of the Good News
which has come to you, even as it is in all

2489
03:14:49,944 --> 03:14:56,484
the world and is bearing fruit and growing,
as it does in you also, since the day

2490
03:14:56,524 --> 03:15:02,264
you heard and knew the grace of God in
truth, even as you learnt from Epaphras our beloved

2491
03:15:02,304 --> 03:15:08,764
fellow servant, who is a faithful servant
of Christ on your behalf, who also declared

2492
03:15:08,804 --> 03:15:10,724
to us your love in the Spirit.

2493
03:15:11,484 --> 03:15:17,944
For this cause, we also, since the day we
heard this, don’t cease praying and making

2494
03:15:17,984 --> 03:15:23,984
requests for you, that you may be filled
with the knowledge of his will in all spiritual

2495
03:15:24,024 --> 03:15:30,504
wisdom and understanding, that you may walk worthily
of the Lord, to please him in all

2496
03:15:30,544 --> 03:15:37,624
respects, bearing fruit in every good work
and increasing in the knowledge of God, strengthened

2497
03:15:37,664 --> 03:15:44,304
with all power, according to the might
of his glory, for all endurance and perseverance

2498
03:15:44,344 --> 03:15:50,844
with joy, giving thanks to the Father, who
made us fit to be partakers of the inheritance

2499
03:15:50,884 --> 03:15:56,724
of the saints in light, who delivered us
out of the power of darkness, and translated

2500
03:15:56,764 --> 03:16:02,584
us into the Kingdom of the Son of his
love, in whom we have our redemption, the forgiveness

2501
03:16:02,624 --> 03:16:03,584
of our sins.

2502
03:16:04,704 --> 03:16:09,484
He is the image of the invisible God, the
firstborn of all creation.

2503
03:16:10,784 --> 03:16:16,924
For by him all things were created in
the heavens and on the earth, visible things and

2504
03:16:16,964 --> 03:16:22,204
invisible things, whether thrones or
dominions or principalities or powers.

2505
03:16:23,124 --> 03:16:26,584
All things have been created through him
and for him.

2506
03:16:27,524 --> 03:16:31,904
He is before all things, and in him all
things are held together.

2507
03:16:32,944 --> 03:16:38,484
He is the head of the body, the
assembly, who is the beginning, the firstborn from the

2508
03:16:38,524 --> 03:16:42,424
