earth or things in the heavens, having

2511
03:16:56,136 --> 03:16:58,336
made peace through the blood of his cross.

2512
03:16:58,956 --> 03:17:05,916
You, being in past times alienated and enemies
in your mind in your evil deeds, yet

2513
03:17:05,956 --> 03:17:12,316
now he has reconciled in the body of
his flesh through death, to present you holy and

2514
03:17:12,356 --> 03:17:18,296
without defect and blameless before him, if it
is so that you continue in the faith,

2515
03:17:19,076 --> 03:17:25,096
grounded and steadfast, and not moved away from
the hope of the Good News which you heard,

2516
03:17:25,556 --> 03:17:31,536
which is being proclaimed in all creation
under heaven, of which I, Paul, was made a

2517
03:17:31,576 --> 03:17:32,476
servant.

2518
03:17:32,636 --> 03:17:39,056
Now I rejoice in my sufferings for your sake,
and fill up on my part that which is lacking

2519
03:17:39,096 --> 03:17:45,096
