for his body’s sake, which is the assembly,

2520
03:17:45,136 --> 03:17:50,836
of which I was made a servant according to
the stewardship of God which was given me

2521
03:17:50,876 --> 03:17:57,376
towards you to fulfil the word of God, the
mystery which has been hidden for ages and

2522
03:17:57,416 --> 03:17:58,316
generations.

2523
03:17:58,636 --> 03:18:04,576
But now it has been revealed to his saints,
to whom God was pleased to make known what

2524
03:18:04,616 --> 03:18:10,256
are the riches of the glory of this
mystery amongst the Gentiles, which is Christ in

2525
03:18:10,296 --> 03:18:12,116
you, the hope of glory.

2526
03:18:12,816 --> 03:18:19,476
We proclaim him, admonishing every man and
teaching every man in all wisdom, that

2527
03:18:19,516 --> 03:18:25,976
we may present every man perfect in Christ
Jesus; for which I also labour,

2528
03:18:26,016 --> 03:18:29,996
striving according to his working, which
works in me mightily.

2529
03:18:30,476 --> 03:18:32,516
Colossians, chapter two.

2530
03:18:32,556 --> 03:18:38,316
For I desire to have you know how greatly
I struggle for you and for those at Laodicea,

2531
03:18:38,696 --> 03:18:44,416
and for as many as have not seen my
face in the flesh; that their hearts may be comforted,

2532
03:18:45,016 --> 03:18:51,276
they being knit together in love, and gaining
all riches of the full assurance of understanding,

2533
03:18:51,916 --> 03:18:58,416
that they may know the mystery of God,
both of the Father and of Christ, in whom

2534
03:18:58,456 --> 03:19:01,236
all the treasures of wisdom and knowledge
are hidden.

2535
03:19:01,589 --> 03:19:06,469
Now I say this that no one may delude you
with persuasiveness of speech.

2536
03:19:07,589 --> 03:19:13,929
For though I am absent in the flesh, yet
I am with you in the spirit, rejoicing and seeing

2537
03:19:13,969 --> 03:19:17,669
your order, and the steadfastness of your
faith in Christ.

2538
03:19:17,709 --> 03:19:24,269
As therefore you received Christ Jesus the
Lord, walk in him, rooted and

2539
03:19:24,309 --> 03:19:30,709
built up in him and established in the
faith, even as you were taught, abounding in it

2540
03:19:30,749 --> 03:19:31,649
in thanksgiving.

2541
03:19:32,049 --> 03:19:36,749
Be careful that you don’t let anyone
rob you through his philosophy and vain deceit,

2542
03:19:37,629 --> 03:19:43,689
after the tradition of men, after the elemental
spirits of the world, and not after Christ.

2543
03:19:44,349 --> 03:19:50,409
For in him all the fullness of the Deity
dwells bodily, and in him you are made full,

2544
03:19:51,129 --> 03:19:53,869
who is the head of all principality and
power.

2545
03:19:54,289 --> 03:20:00,309
In him you were also circumcised with a
circumcision not made with hands, in the putting

2546
03:20:00,349 --> 03:20:05,909
off of the body of the sins of the flesh,
in the circumcision of Christ, having been

2547
03:20:05,949 --> 03:20:11,569
buried with him in baptism, in which you
were also raised with him through faith in the

2548
03:20:11,609 --> 03:20:14,629
working of God, who raised him from the
dead.

2549
03:20:15,449 --> 03:20:19,909
You were dead through your trespasses and
the uncircumcision of your flesh.

2550
03:20:20,509 --> 03:20:27,109
He made you alive together with him,
having forgiven us all our trespasses, wiping out

2551
03:20:27,149 --> 03:20:30,069
the handwriting in ordinances which was
against us.

2552
03:20:31,049 --> 03:20:34,389
He has taken it out of the way, nailing it
to the cross.

2553
03:20:35,069 --> 03:20:41,009
Having stripped the principalities and the powers,
he made a show of them openly, triumphing

2554
03:20:41,049 --> 03:20:41,949
over them in it.

2555
03:20:42,669 --> 03:20:48,069
Let no one therefore judge you in eating
or drinking, or with respect to a feast day

2556
03:20:48,109 --> 03:20:54,289
or a new moon or a Sabbath day, which are
a shadow of the things to come; but the body

2557
03:20:54,329 --> 03:20:55,289
is Christ’s.

2558
03:20:55,434 --> 03:21:02,634
Let no one rob you of your prize
by self-abasement and worshipping of the angels, dwelling

2559
03:21:02,674 --> 03:21:09,214
in the things which he has not seen,
vainly puffed up by his fleshly mind, and

2560
03:21:09,254 --> 03:21:15,894
not holding firmly to the Head, from whom
all the body, being supplied and knit together

2561
03:21:15,934 --> 03:21:19,514
through the joints and ligaments, grows
with God’s growth.

2562
03:21:20,194 --> 03:21:26,814
If you died with Christ from the elemental
spirits of the world, why, as though living

2563
03:21:26,854 --> 03:21:33,134
in the world, do you subject yourselves to
ordinances, “Don’t handle, nor taste, nor

2564
03:21:33,174 --> 03:21:39,254
touch” (all of which perish with use),
according to the precepts and doctrines of men?

2565
03:21:39,934 --> 03:21:45,914
These things indeed appear like wisdom
in self-imposed worship, humility, and severity

2566
03:21:45,954 --> 03:21:51,094
to the body, but aren’t of any value
against the indulgence of the flesh.

2567
03:21:52,294 --> 03:21:54,574
Colossians, chapter three.

2568
03:21:54,614 --> 03:22:00,654
If then you were raised together with Christ,
seek the things that are above, where Christ

2569
03:22:00,694 --> 03:22:03,454
is, seated on the right hand of God.

2570
03:22:04,314 --> 03:22:09,414
Set your mind on the things that are above,
not on the things that are on the earth.

2571
03:22:09,774 --> 03:22:13,574
For you died, and your life is hidden with
Christ in God.

2572
03:22:14,234 --> 03:22:19,954
When Christ, our life, is revealed, then you
will also be revealed with him in glory.

2573
03:22:21,074 --> 03:22:27,574
Put to death therefore your members which
are on the earth: sexual immorality, uncleanness,

2574
03:22:28,054 --> 03:22:33,274
depraved passion, evil desire, and
covetousness, which is idolatry.

2575
03:22:33,874 --> 03:22:38,194
For these things’ sake the wrath of God
comes on the children of disobedience.

2576
03:22:39,434 --> 03:22:45,494
You also once walked in those, when you lived
in them, but now you must put them all

2577
03:22:45,534 --> 03:22:52,194
away: anger, wrath, malice, slander, and
shameful speaking out of your mouth.

2578
03:22:53,214 --> 03:22:58,914
Don’t lie to one another, seeing that you have
put off the old man with his doings, and

2579
03:22:58,954 --> 03:23:04,254
have put on the new man, who is being
renewed in knowledge after the image of his Creator,

2580
03:23:05,094 --> 03:23:11,654
where there can’t be Greek and
Jew, circumcision and uncircumcision, barbarian, Scythian,

2581
03:23:12,074 --> 03:23:17,234
bondservant, or free person; but Christ is
all, and in all.

2582
03:23:17,548 --> 03:23:24,428
Put on therefore, as God’s chosen ones,
holy and beloved, a heart of compassion,

2583
03:23:25,308 --> 03:23:32,028
kindness, lowliness, humility, and
perseverance; bearing with one

2584
03:23:32,068 --> 03:23:38,768
another, and forgiving each other, if any
man has a complaint against any; even

2585
03:23:38,808 --> 03:23:41,868
as Christ forgave you, so you also do.

2586
03:23:42,568 --> 03:23:47,568
Above all these things, walk in love,
which is the bond of perfection.

2587
03:23:48,648 --> 03:23:55,008
And let the peace of God rule in your
hearts, to which also you were called in one body,

2588
03:23:55,568 --> 03:23:56,468
and be thankful.

2589
03:23:57,588 --> 03:24:03,388
Let the word of Christ dwell in you
richly; in all wisdom teaching and admonishing one

2590
03:24:03,428 --> 03:24:09,968
another with psalms, hymns, and spiritual
songs, singing with grace in your heart

2591
03:24:10,008 --> 03:24:10,908
to the Lord.

2592
03:24:10,988 --> 03:24:17,768
Whatever you do, in word or in deed, do
all in the name of the Lord Jesus, giving

2593
03:24:17,808 --> 03:24:20,148
thanks to God the Father through him.

2594
03:24:20,728 --> 03:24:25,848
Wives, be in subjection to your husbands,
as is fitting in the Lord.

2595
03:24:26,908 --> 03:24:31,328
Husbands, love your wives, and don’t be
bitter against them.

2596
03:24:31,968 --> 03:24:37,408
Children, obey your parents in all things,
for this pleases the Lord.

2597
03:24:37,868 --> 03:24:42,148
Fathers, don’t provoke your children, so
that they won’t be discouraged.

2598
03:24:43,148 --> 03:24:49,788
Servants, obey in all things those who are
your masters according to the flesh, not just

2599
03:24:49,828 --> 03:24:55,588
when they are looking, as men pleasers,
but in singleness of heart, fearing God.

2600
03:24:56,308 --> 03:25:02,768
And whatever you do, work heartily, as for
the Lord and not for men, knowing

2601
03:25:02,808 --> 03:25:08,488
that from the Lord you will receive the
reward of the inheritance; for you serve the

2602
03:25:08,528 --> 03:25:09,428
Lord Christ.

2603
03:25:09,688 --> 03:25:15,308
But he who does wrong will receive again for
the wrong that he has done, and there is

2604
03:25:15,348 --> 03:25:16,588
no partiality.

2605
03:25:17,108 --> 03:25:19,968
Colossians, chapter four.

2606
03:25:20,008 --> 03:25:26,668
Masters, give to your servants that which
is just and equal, knowing that you also

2607
03:25:26,708 --> 03:25:28,088
have a Master in heaven.

2608
03:25:28,668 --> 03:25:35,388
Continue steadfastly in prayer, watching in
it with thanksgiving, praying together for

2609
03:25:35,428 --> 03:25:41,948
us also, that God may open to us a door
for the word, to speak the mystery

2610
03:25:41,988 --> 03:25:48,228
of Christ, for which I am also in bonds,
that I may reveal it as I ought to speak.

2611
03:25:48,643 --> 03:25:53,743
Walk in wisdom towards those who are
outside, redeeming the time.

2612
03:25:54,743 --> 03:26:01,363
Let your speech always be with grace,
seasoned with salt, that you may know how

2613
03:26:01,403 --> 03:26:03,143
you ought to answer each one.

2614
03:26:04,003 --> 03:26:10,443
All my affairs will be made known to
you by Tychicus, the beloved brother, faithful servant,

2615
03:26:11,043 --> 03:26:13,123
and fellow bondservant in the Lord.

2616
03:26:13,553 --> 03:26:19,723
I am sending him to you for this
very purpose, that he may know your circumstances and

2617
03:26:19,763 --> 03:26:26,023
comfort your hearts, together with Onesimus,
the faithful and beloved brother, who is

2618
03:26:26,063 --> 03:26:26,963
one of you.

2619
03:26:27,523 --> 03:26:31,383
They will make known to you everything
that is going on here.

2620
03:26:32,223 --> 03:26:38,623
Aristarchus, my fellow prisoner, greets you,
and Mark the cousin of Barnabas (concerning

2621
03:26:38,663 --> 03:26:45,113
whom you received instructions, “if he comes
to you, receive him”), and Jesus who is

2622
03:26:45,153 --> 03:26:46,513
called Justus.

2623
03:26:46,553 --> 03:26:52,933
These are my only fellow workers for God’s
Kingdom who are of the circumcision, men who

2624
03:26:52,973 --> 03:26:54,213
have been a comfort to me.

2625
03:26:54,253 --> 03:27:01,293
Epaphras, who is one of you, a servant of
Christ, salutes you, always

2626
03:27:01,333 --> 03:27:07,173
striving for you in his prayers, that you
may stand perfect and complete in all the will

2627
03:27:07,213 --> 03:27:08,093
of God.

2628
03:27:08,133 --> 03:27:14,893
For I testify about him that he has great
zeal for you, and for those in Laodicea,

2629
03:27:14,933 --> 03:27:17,053
and for those in Hierapolis.

2630
03:27:17,093 --> 03:27:20,373
Luke the beloved physician and Demas greet
you.

2631
03:27:21,213 --> 03:27:26,893
Greet the brothers who are in Laodicea, with
Nymphas and the assembly that is in his

2632
03:27:26,933 --> 03:27:27,833
house.

2633
03:27:28,293 --> 03:27:33,773
When this letter has been read amongst you,
cause it to be read also in the assembly

2634
03:27:33,813 --> 03:27:39,413
of the Laodiceans, and that you also read
the letter from Laodicea.

2635
03:27:39,453 --> 03:27:45,493
Tell Archippus, “Take heed to the ministry
which you have received in the Lord, that

2636
03:27:45,533 --> 03:27:46,493
you fulfil it.”

2637
03:27:47,653 --> 03:27:51,013
I, Paul, write this greeting with my own
hand.

2638
03:27:51,873 --> 03:27:52,853
Remember my chains.

2639
03:27:54,193 --> 03:27:55,093
Grace be with you.

2640
03:27:55,553 --> 03:27:56,453
Amen.

